    "factual": "Evaluate all146reserved recording3 windows and124factual tracking tapes in identical default32 execution for both fitted arms. Retain by-horizon physical component errors, per-recording and pooled results.",
    "summary": "Reuse action-response-v1 absolute/directional/magnitude reporting for each arm. Qualification uses pooled group RMS error, not median ratios inflated by tiny true effects. Each paired command response is alternative minus own baseline.",
    "primary_gate": {
