      "response_scores": "Six equal-weight scores: RMS vector error of paired responses at first50ms and flattened full5steps, separately for velocity/bodyrate/rotation entries, over all744signed probes. Candidate/baseline error ratio uses floor1e-12 in the physical group error to avoid division byzero.",
      "response_geomean_ratio_maximum": 0.8,
